mode: "100644"
text: "# The WARMS framework — warm, consent-first DM selling\n\nThe action moved to the inbox (88–90% open rates), but DMs only work as a **response to intent**, never\nas cold outreach. WARMS is the consent-first funnel: earn the trigger, reply warm and fast, deliver value,\nmove to an owned channel, stay compliant. The agent designs + drafts; **WoopSocial has no DM surface** —\nit publishes the trigger posts; the DM step is an external official-API tool or a human.\n\n## W — Wait for the trigger (consent-first)\n- Only message people who **opted in**: commented your keyword, replied to a Story, followed, or DM'd you.\n  **Never cold.** Earn the opt-in with a **\"comment KEYWORD and I'll DM you [magnet]\"** trigger post.\n\n## A — Answer fast + human\n- Reply **inside the 24h window**, ideally within ~1 minute (massively higher conversion). **Warm, short,\n  specific, one question, a clear next step.** **No links or URL shorteners in the first message.** Never\n  ticket-speak.\n\n## R — Relate, don't pitch\n- **Deliver the value they asked for first.** Map **distinct messages to distinct triggers** (a \"pricing\"\n  comment ≠ a Story reply) — one generic flow feels like spam. Personalize; build the relationship before\n  any offer.\n\n## M — Move to owned + qualify\n- **Capture the email natively in the DM**; qualify intent; **route high-intent to a human.** Compress any\n  promo into the **24h window**, then move the relationship to **email** (→ `email-and-newsletter`) — don't\n  chase outside the window.\n\n## S — Stay compliant + safe\n- **Official Meta API tools only** (never scraping/password/unofficial — ~27× the ban risk). Respect\n  **limits/pacing**, **one link max**, **no shorteners**, **no spam words**, **consent + opt-out**,\n  **public disclosures**. **Never fabricate** DM/conversion metrics.\n\n## The DM-funnel brief a request should fill\n```\nTRIGGER: the opt-in CTA (\"comment KEYWORD\") + the post that carries it (WoopSocial publishes this)\nDM SEQUENCE: warm reply -> deliver value -> capture email -> one next step (within 24h)\nTRIGGER-MATCHED: distinct messages per trigger; personalized; one question each\nHANDOFF: high-intent -> human; relationship -> email (off-platform after 24h)\nSAFETY: official Meta API tool (or manual warm sending); limits, one link, no shorteners, opt-out, disclosures\nMEASURE: DM conversations / email captures from the external tool (never fabricated)\n```\n"
